      "title": "Note",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "ComfyUI-Fibo2 — Fibo 2.0 Edit Turbo\n\nUpload your own source image in Load Image and write the edit instruction. No example photograph is bundled.\n\nSelect the converted Fibo checkpoint in models/diffusion_models, a full Qwen3-VL-4B BF16 or INT8 ConvRot encoder in models/text_encoders, and the standard FLUX.2 VAE in models/vae. Leave loader dtype at default.\n\nUse four Euler steps, BasicGuider (CFG 1) and Fibo2 Scheduler. Width/height must be multiples of 16 and feed both conditioning and the empty latent.\n\nAdditional reference sockets grow as connected; refer to <image_1>, <image_2>, etc. Prompts accept direct instructions or VGL JSON. White mask regions are regenerated; describe the desired contents.\n\nUnofficial integration. Original model: Bria AI, CC BY-NC 4.0; commercial use requires a Bria agreement. See README and NOTICE for source credits and component licenses."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "ComfyUI-Fibo2 — Fibo 2.0 Edit Turbo\n\nUpload your own source image in Load Image and write the edit instruction. No example photograph is bundled.\n\nSelect the converted Fibo checkpoint in models/diffusion_models, a full Qwen3-VL-4B BF16 or INT8 ConvRot encoder in models/text_encoders, and the standard FLUX.2 VAE in models/vae. Leave loader dtype at default.\n\nUse four Euler steps, BasicGuider (CFG 1) and Fibo2 Scheduler. Width/height must be multiples of 16 and feed both conditioning and the empty latent.\n\nAdditional reference sockets grow as connected; refer to <image_1>, <image_2>, etc. Prompts accept direct instructions or VGL JSON. White mask regions are regenerated; describe the desired contents.\n\nUnofficial integration. Original model: Bria AI, CC BY-NC 4.0; commercial use requires a Bria agreement. See README and NOTICE for source credits and component licenses."
      },
